PN,35101
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FFrom stationary to building projects,
OL,7,Fthe States of Guernsey needs to draw
OL,8,Fon the expertise and contacts of
OL,9,Fothers to deliver vital public
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FAnd it does this through a procurement
OL,13,Fportal.
OL,15,FFirst you have to register as a
OL,16,Fsupplier, then you have to express an
OL,17,Finterest in a project or job.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FThen you have to submit a detailed
OL,7,Fbid, which needs to include a wealth
OL,8,Fof information ranging from pricing
OL,9,Fstructures to proof of insurance.
OL,11,FIf your bid is successful, you can
OL,12,Fthen be brought on as a supplier - a
OL,13,Fprocess in and of itself.
OL,15,FSome smaller companies say all the
OL,16,Fbureaucracy is starting to put people
OL,17,Foff.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FBen Tustin from Guernsey Seaweed told
OL,7,FITV News: "I think the biggest problem
OL,8,Fwith the States' procurement process
OL,9,Fis actually the process itself. It's
OL,10,Fvery clearly designed for a very large
OL,11,Fcountry.
OL,13,F"So if you're looking at multi-million
OL,14,Fpound contracts, the procurement
OL,15,Fportal would work wonderfully. But it
OL,16,Frequires an enormous amount of
OL,17,Finformation for any supplier to put
OL,18,Finto it, in order to even be able to
OL,19,Fregister on the portal, let alone
OL,20,Factually make a tender.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,F"Big companies, particularly UK and
OL,7,Fconsultancy companies, they have
OL,8,Fentire departments set up to be able
OL,9,Fto complete tenders on procurement
OL,10,Fportals. A small business in Guernsey
OL,11,Fjust doesn't have that level of
OL,12,Fresource.
OL,14,F"The fundamental problem that I've got
OL,15,Fis that local businesses don't want to
OL,16,Fdo it because it takes so much time."
OL,18,FAnd it's not just small companies that
OL,19,Fhave noticed this.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FBrent Green is the Managing Director
OL,7,Fof the Breton Group. The construction
OL,8,Ffirm has submitted numerous bids over
OL,9,Fthe past few years, and understands
OL,10,Fwhy a company like Guernsey Seaweed
OL,11,Fwould be frustrated.
OL,13,FHe says: "It requires a lot of
OL,14,Fattention to detail to tender for
OL,15,Fworks, whether it's #10,000 or
OL,16,F#500,000. The requirements are very
OL,17,Flaborious.
OL,19,F"That has to be repeated with every
OL,20,Ftender we put in, which costs quite a
OL,21,Fsubstantial amount of money."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FBrent adds: "We consider the States
OL,7,Fand the public bodies an important
OL,8,Fpart of us, and we want to continue
OL,9,Fworking with them. It's important for
OL,10,Fthe local construction industry and I
OL,11,Fhope that we are able to get into a
OL,12,Fslightly more improved situation."
OL,14,FThe Government's Commercial Director
OL,15,Faccepts that the process is time
OL,16,Fconsuming, but argues that there's a
OL,17,Freason.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,FSimon Steele says: "We do encourage
OL,7,FSMEs (small and medium enterprises) to
OL,8,Fapply to work with us and they will be
OL,9,Fafforded equal opportunity when
OL,10,Fresponding to opportunities.
OL,12,F"We do also recognise that as a
OL,13,Fgovernment buyer, there is information
OL,14,Fwe will request of organisations which
OL,15,Fother buyers may not, e.g. copies of
OL,16,Finsurance documents and information on
OL,17,Fhealth and safety procedures.
OL,26,@oD@FpmoD@cpn
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,F"I appreciate that to some this may
OL,7,Fseem like unnecessary administration
OL,8,Fand discourage organisations from
OL,9,Fapplying. However, as a government,
OL,10,Fusing public money, there is
OL,11,Fappropriately a greater obligation on
OL,12,Fus to perform such checks.
OL,14,F"We do also need to perform
OL,15,Fprocurement processes in a manner
OL,16,Fwhich can be scrutinised to ensure it
OL,17,Fwas fair, equitable and objective.
OL,18,FBeing held to account in this manner
OL,19,Fis a very different standard than
OL,20,Fothers are judged by, and consequently
OL,21,Fdemands structure and process.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786996104
OL,3,CStates defends 'laborious' tender
OL,4,Cprocess
OL,6,F"We do seek to consolidate spend,
OL,7,Fwhich means that we will look to
OL,8,Forganise and buy items as categories
OL,9,Frather than individual items. For
OL,10,Fexample, we would buy cleaning
OL,11,Fsupplies as a package as opposed to
OL,12,Fjust soap."
OL,14,FThis might make it difficult for
OL,15,Fsmaller companies, but some would say
OL,16,Fit's a necessary way of avoiding
OL,17,Fclaims of conflicts of interest and
OL,18,Fwasted taxpayer money.
OL,20,FAnd it's clear the process isn't
OL,21,Flikely to change anytime soon.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
